  m_Text: "Remember that kid from earlier ? The one that went to Ukraine to \"summon
    the Satan\" ? Well, he actually did it. There's one problem though... The pastafarians
    were right.\n\nThat kid ACTUALLY summoned living pasta monsters, that now run
    around and eat people. \n\nGreat - Now, it's your job to stop them. No like,
    really, they've given you absolutely nothing and sent you near the summoning
    zone. "
